{"about_the_game":"A detective mystery set in the political powder-keg of Barcelona in 1977. You play Jorge, a retired policeman who uses a wheelchair, struggling with a difficult past. Alone on your balcony, you watch the world pass by through binoculars.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1034750/extras/9d07f76f6eaac3594ec447d9c3a2df09.poster.avif?t=1773261702\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1034750/extras/9d07f76f6eaac3594ec447d9c3a2df09.webm?t=1773261702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1034750/extras/9d07f76f6eaac3594ec447d9c3a2df09.mp4?t=1773261702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1034750/extras/1781b8b7b4493f60b66253e8d4d34952.webp?t=1773261702\" width=600 height=44 /></span><br><br>One stormy night, you witness a murder. Determined to uncover the truth, you form an unlikely alliance with young ambitious journalist Melinda and start your investigation. <br><br>Together, you\u2019ll solve a complex mystery by unravelling the secrets of unsuspecting neighbours.<br><br>Inspired by classic crime noir films and games like Campo Santo's Firewatch, The Flower Collectors is a detective story with a whole lot of heart.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1034750/extras/efecd07f53b1b8713303e4d3ad9d5022.webp?t=1773261702\" width=600 height=44 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve a captivating murder mystery with an unusual storyline<br></li><li>Meet a host of colourful anthropomorphic characters in a lush, atmospheric world<br></li><li>Investigate using your binoculars, camera and transmitter to uncover neighborhood secrets from your balcony<br></li><li>Create a crime chronology to figure out whodunnit<br></li><li>Interrogate priests, beggars, club singers and nosy old ladies alike<br></li><li>Dive into the unique setting of post-Franco Barcelona in the 70ies<br></li><li>Emphasizes characters, world building and narrative over skill challenges</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"104a11fb1068c224baa415158b83c82229af92dd.jpg","localized_name":"Mystery Solver - Rookie","name":"Mystery Solver - Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1034750/104a11fb1068c224baa415158b83c82229af92dd.jpg"},{"icon":"9e126f09819464f82cd5390a025ceb0a957312b8.jpg","localized_name":"Mystery Solver - Chief of Police","name":"Mystery Solver - Chief of Police","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1034750/9e126f09819464f82cd5390a025ceb0a957312b8.jpg"},{"icon":"765daf2ff83945ae1e5619b127c1aba6cff0502b.jpg","localized_name":"No More Lies","name":"No More Lies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1034750/765daf2ff83945ae1e5619b127c1aba6cff0502b.jpg"},{"icon":"a3fd2d80fe3a26a4980224426c16d84acd192bf1.jpg","localized_name":"Self Defense","name":"Self Defense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1034750/a3fd2d80fe3a26a4980224426c16d84acd192bf1.jpg"},{"icon":"0e5be9c8bfaf5936f28b19902e68034095428ee3.jpg","localized_name":"Moral Standards","name":"Moral Standards","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1034750/0e5be9c8bfaf5936f28b19902e68034095428ee3.jpg"},{"icon":"8946f54e0afbd559963e47846a167454a8548698.jpg","localized_name":"Snitch","name":"Snitch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1034750/8946f54e0afbd559963e47846a167454a8548698.jpg"},{"icon":"e27864a43a05822d761147f90783578b57c94d87.jpg","locali